Text: MEMBERSHIPGet the best journaling experience with our Membership, offering easy access to the Journey app and services.12 months of Unlimited journeysMembership (Annual)$4.17/mo billed annually, cancel anytime.Try it Now— OR —Save more with lifetime purchaseBy proceeding, you are agreeing to the terms as shown in the information section below.What you get with Journey® MembershipCross-platform SyncExperience Journey's transformative power on all platforms with exclusive access. Seamlessly sync your experiences, from the convenience of your smartphone to the versatility of your tablet and the comfort of your desktop.End-to-end EncryptionProtect your most intimate thoughts and cherished memories with Journey's state-of-the-art end-to-end encryption. Experience unparalleled peace of mind as your personal journal remains securely encrypted from creation to storage, ensuring only you have access to your private world.Shared JournalsCollaborate and create together as you embark on a collective journey of memories, insights, and experiences. Whether it's a group adventure, or a communal diary, the shared journal feature provides a platform for shared expression, fostering stronger bonds and cherished moments that will last a lifetime.Shared Web LinksGenerate web links for selected entries in Journey Cloud Sync to share your journal with others. Friends and family can view the journal entries you share directly in their browser, without downloading Journey.I'm sharing moments from my daily life with you through this link.Journey | My Daily Life 2026https://webLink.journey.cloud/v1/Thanks for sharing these moments from your daily life with me! ❤️Coach ProgramsWith the guidance of expert coaches, unlock your full potential with Journey's extensive library of 60+ guided journaling coach programs. From self-discovery to personal growth, mindfulness to gratitude, each program is meticulously designed to inspire and empower you on your journey.Custom Journal TemplatesExpress yourself in a way that resonates with your unique style and preferences by designing your own journal templates. From colorful layouts to curated sections, customize every aspect of your journal to create a truly personalized reflection of your journey. With Journey's custom templates, your journal becomes a canvas for self-expression and creativity.Chat With Your Journal Using Odyssey AIPowered by Generative Pre-trained Transformer (GPT), Journey's Odyssey AI provides a conversational approach to memory exploration. You can ask Odyssey AI questions about your own life, patterns, moods, and the progress toward your goals. It then generates insightful, personalized responses, drawing from the treasure trove of self-revelations contained within your past entries.Hello, I am Journey Odyssey AI, your AI journal assistant. Please ask me a question about your journal.Can you share with me more about this person called Hazel?Hazel appears to be a beloved person frequently mentioned in the journal entries. Here are some highlights: Hazel was excited to receive a ukulele from her aunt. She had her first field trip away from the city, which she loved.You can view the mentioned entries below:Zapier AutomationAutomate your journal entries effortlessly by connecting Journey with the other apps and services you use daily. From capturing your fitness achievements to logging your social media milestones, Zapier integration empowers you to streamline your journaling process and capture every moment that matters.Compose Journal Via EmailSimply send your thoughts, reflections, and memories directly to your unique email address assigned by Journey, and watch as they seamlessly appear in your journal. Whether you're on the go or prefer the simplicity of email, this feature ensures you never miss capturing a special moment.Print Your Journals Into Beautiful eBooksWith a few simple clicks, your cherished memories can transform into elegantly designed eBooks. Cloud Print gives you a new way to celebrate and immortalize your experiences, ensuring your stories can be cherished by you and future generations.Export Your Journal to ePUB & DocxExport your journals to ePUB and DOCX formats, turning them into beautiful eBooks. Supported by applications like Apple Books, Amazon Kindle, and Microsoft Word, these formats make it easy to read and share your journal entries with anyone.And So Much More.Unlock text formatting features such as bold, italics, tables, bullet lists, text color, and more.10GB of storage size for the primary Journey Cloud Sync drive.5,000 entries for primary Journey Cloud Sync drive.Attach up to 20 photo / video / audio files per journal entry.Retrieve historical weather data up to 12 months prior.Choose up to 13 colored themes in the journal.Time-travel through memories with Throwback.Search for places and add geo-tags to your journal entries.50 web links, each containing up to 31 entries.Print from the cloud up to 1,000 entries per month.Export to ePub & docx up to 1,000 entries per month.Priority help desk support.Try it NowPeople Love Journey.Over 100,000 5-star reviewsRating 0 of 5Rating 1 of 5Rating 2 of 5Rating 3 of 5Rating 4 of 5Rating 5 of 5Jee Wang@jeewang85Atlas is easily one of my favorite feature in @myjourneyapp, love how it beautifully display my 8 days Annapurna Base Camp trek journal on a map!View moreJuan Compres@JuanCarlCompres@myjourneyapp I love your app. Got the Android app yesterday and became a premium user after some minutes of using it. Today I became a member. You can tell I'm serious about journaling and your app and services are making it easier. Thanks!View more@edisoncross35.7k followersI’ve been using @myjourney.app for a while now to note down my daily musing. Love how simple it is to use. No fuss at all. Just a safe space for me to be totally honest and reflect.View moreThis dude is vegan@thisdudeisveganIf you want to write a diary to save your memories or to take notes for e.g. but don't like "classic book
